{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13167","headline":"送从弟豫贬远州 · 皇甫冉","name":"送从弟豫贬远州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事成迁客，思归不见乡。\n游吴经万里，吊屈过三湘。\n水与荆巫接，山通鄢郢长。\n名嗟黄绶系，才是白眉良。\n独结南枝恨，应思北雁行。\n忧来沽楚酒，玄鬓莫凝霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}